  and it applies to all adults 18 and over  children  are exempt children under 18 are exempt  and so are people who eat  outside meyer also founded the burger  chain shake shack but vaccination policy  you got to be vaccinated does not apply  to them they are a publicly traded  company  danny meyer joins us now at the table  welcome thank you good morning  how do you verify that someone is  vaccinated like what what kind of proof  do you want  and how do you confirm that the proof  they're giving you is legit  well there are definitely cards that the  cdc has provided to  show proof of vaccination and there's  also digital  uh proof as well clear has a wonderful  app called health pass which anybody can  get for free  in new york state we have excelsior pass  and we'll take a look at all of those  you intend to be police this very  carefully i mean check ids to make sure  that you're actually seeing  the the card actually it belongs to that  person the most important thing for us  to  check is our staff we care so deeply we  have a  pretty sacred responsibility to make  sure that it's safe to work in our  restaurants  keep in mind when you dine in a  restaurant you cannot wear a mask while  you're eating and drinking  and our staff members don't have a  choice but to serve you and so  if if our staff members are with you for  two two and a half hours  i want to make sure first of all that  they're safe and we're going to do  everything we can  obviously to make sure that those people  who choose to eat with us are also safe  you're getting a lot of applause danny  for doing this many people hope that  businesses will follow suit and follow  your lead but it also comes with some  heat too  are you concerned about the backlash was  this a tough decision for you  to reach it's an easy decision if the  question is  what's the right thing to do it's only a  tough decision if you're trying to take  the easy path  i would say that most people have told  us  this makes me 